WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
This site's CMS is a git repository.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:13.900
Everything the site shows is a JSON document: structure documents, per-language dictionaries and field manifests — joined once at build time.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:31.900
?edit turns the live site into the editor. HTTP Basic at the nginx proxy is the only gate; every save is a commit through the GitHub Contents API.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:42.900
Content lives as JSON in the repository: branches are previews, and merging to master publishes.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:54.900
Merging to master runs the GitHub Actions pipeline — build, resume PDFs, deploy — from commit to live in minutes.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Edit on the live site. Stored in git. Live on merge to master.
